Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:06:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 4621: POST /members/:id/intro-request asks the first friend
 on the path for the introduction
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The frontend's 21:10Z item 4 (Misho's yes): the member card's „გაცნობის თხოვნა“. The route reads the owner's paths to that person (chainMapsFor), takes the first friend on the best path who uses Netai (firstAskableBridge), and makes the same request as request_introduction, optionally under the owner's goal. It answers 201 with the request id and the owner's thread for it; refusals are codes (404 no_such_person / no_such_goal, 409 no_bridge_on_netai / not_sent). Rate-limited to 5 a minute. FOR_FRONTEND carries the contract.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
